### Default URL
GET http://localhost:5000/

### Default API URL
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/

###
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/6ad22b95d05e26f22985d238

###
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/6ad22b95d05e26f22985d238 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Nouveau Nom",
    "age": 30
}

###
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/6ad22b95d05e26f22985d238

### 1. Inscription d'un utilisateur (Register)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "etudiant@exemple.fr",
    "password": "MotDePasse123!"
}

### 2. Connexion et récupération du token (Login)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "etudiant@exemple.fr",
    "password": "MotDePasse123!"
}

### 3. Route protégée : Récupérer tous les contacts
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjZhZjVmYmZiYjQ3ZDVjMzgxNmZkNDRjYSIsImVtYWlsIjoiZXR1ZGlhbnRAZXhlbXBsZS5mciIsImlhdCI6MTc5NDUwNTcyOCwiZXhwIjoxNzk0NTkyMTI4fQ.HLfAX7bB5EOqgPZLQNwo6WWOlDNBhmnU2GHo6nisads

### 4. Route protégée : Ajouter un contact
POST http://localhost:5000/api/contacts HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjZhZjVmYmZiYjQ3ZDVjMzgxNmZkNDRjYSIsImVtYWlsIjoiZXR1ZGlhbnRAZXhlbXBsZS5mciIsImlhdCI6MTc5NDUwNTcyOCwiZXhwIjoxNzk0NTkyMTI4fQ.HLfAX7bB5EOqgPZLQNwo6WWOlDNBhmnU2GHo6nisads

